<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">maintaining the equipment in good working order and condition during the term of the lease; and </FONT></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT
