 <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The investment committee will make investment decisions using the investment policies described in this
prospectus and the undertakings set forth under &#147;Conflicts of Interest.&#148; All potential equipment acquisitions will be evaluated on the basis of: </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P>
