</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">If Fund Eleven were classified as a PTP, it would be treated
for federal income tax purposes as a corporation unless, as noted above, 90% or more of its income were to come from certain &#147;qualified sources.&#148; Fund Eleven&#146;s business will be the leasing of personal (but not real) property, and
