<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">the LLC Agreement must provide that if a member will have a deficit balance in his or her capital account upon liquidation of the limited liability company, the member either must
