situation, including aspects unrelated to the limited liability company, will be taken into account. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P
STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The LLC Agreement contains several provisions designed to ensure that allocations have a substantial economic effect. </FONT></P> <P
