<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">It requires that all allocations of income, gains, losses, deductions and distributions are reflected by an increase or decrease in the relevant members&#146; capital accounts.
</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P>
