<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">All members who are allocated losses and deductions generated by assets acquired with borrowed money will be charged back income and gains generated by those assets.
</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P>
