<A NAME="rom80221_115"></A>Treatment of Cash Distributions Upon Redemption or Repurchase </B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT
FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The redemption or repurchase by Fund Eleven of all or a portion of your shares will be treated as a sale or exchange of the shares for income tax purposes and may generate taxable income to you. The amount you realize
